NOTICES: DATA UNDER SEPARATE LICENSES

The MIT license above covers this project's code. It does not cover every
data file in the addresses/ directory:

* addresses/phishing.json contains address data derived from ScamSniffer's
  scam-database (https://github.com/scamsniffer/scam-database, published by
  Scam Sniffer, scamsniffer.io). That data is licensed under the GNU General
  Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0) and remains under its own license, separate
  from the MIT license above. Attribution and license details for that data
  are also recorded in addresses/README.md and addresses/MANIFEST.json.

* addresses/ofac.json reproduces Ethereum addresses from the United States
  Department of the Treasury OFAC Specially Designated Nationals (SDN) list,
  as mirrored by the source named in the file itself.
